# tccompare must also compare the length of both strings
Ijade kọ: (['secret'] tccompare: ['']), ila-tuntun.
Ijade kọ: ([''] tccompare: ['secret']), ila-tuntun.
Ijade kọ: (['secret'] tccompare: ['sec']), ila-tuntun.
Ijade kọ: (['sec'] tccompare: ['secret']), ila-tuntun.
Ijade kọ: (['secret'] tccompare: ['secret']), ila-tuntun.
Ijade kọ: ([''] tccompare: ['']), ila-tuntun.
